ClashKing 0.6.2 alpha is ready for closed testing.

- Redesigned Clan Capital, player war stats, Bases & Armies, and Game Assets.
- Faster page navigation and loading with matching skeletons and bundled header artwork.
- Smoother card reordering, scrolling, and account switching on iOS and Android.
- Improved ranked and Legend League history, filters, and battle details.
- Updated app icons, Halloween loading animation, widgets, and translations.
- More accurate Town Hall upgrade limits and ongoing upgrade tracking.

Please report any issues you encounter during testing.
